**Check 1 — did the document register?**

```bash
cd ~/Musaddique/cederanew/cederanew && python3 -c "
from MCP.common.db import get_db_connection
conn = get_db_connection()
cur = conn.cursor()
cur.execute(\"SELECT * FROM treaty_documents WHERE treaty_ref = 'TRT-2026-003'\")
for row in cur.fetchall(): print(dict(row))
cur.close(); conn.close()
"
```

You should see 1 row with the PDF filename and document_id.

